    "detailed_description": "Aimcademy is a <strong>science-based</strong> aim trainer which combines gaming with sport science! This leads to the most efficient way of training by embracing variation and personalization instead of repetition and cookie-cutter tasks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646660/extras/8889d409b8949da16a77b0a03995bece.poster.avif?t=1740673103\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646660/extras/8889d409b8949da16a77b0a03995bece.webm?t=1740673103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646660/extras/8889d409b8949da16a77b0a03995bece.mp4?t=1740673103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Train in the most efficient way by using the power of science! Use our innovative technique-training to improve your aiming skills. We introduce variety in the way you play in order to increase the learning speed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646660/extras/f8ac5ef155ba6a0c1398fc8e231ec53d.poster.avif?t=1740673103\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646660/extras/f8ac5ef155ba6a0c1398fc8e231ec53d.webm?t=1740673103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646660/extras/f8ac5ef155ba6a0c1398fc8e231ec53d.mp4?t=1740673103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Always train in your personal sweet spot where the task is not too hard and not too easy. Make the most progress in the least amount of time with a training tailored to you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi